### Send Location
# Requer token de DRIVER (SCOPE_DRIVER) e a viagem precisa pertencer ao motorista autenticado.
# Rodar antes o "Driver Login" (auth.http) e o "Start Trip" (trip.http) para popular {{tripId}}.
POST {{baseUrl}}/trackings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authTokenDriver}}

{
  "tripId": "{{tripId}}",
  "latitude": -23.550520,
  "longitude": -46.633308
}

### Send Location - próximo ponto (simula deslocamento)
POST {{baseUrl}}/trackings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authTokenDriver}}

{
  "tripId": "{{tripId}}",
  "latitude": -28.551900,
  "longitude": -46.634500
}

